<title>CANADA: Bre-X says directors Kavanagh, Lyons resign.</title>
<headline>Bre-X says directors Kavanagh, Lyons resign.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bre-X Minerals Ltd said on Wednesday that two directors resigned from the boards of Bre-X and its sister companies Bresea Resources Ltd and Bro-X Minerals Ltd.</p>
<p>Bre-X said the resignations of directors H.C. Lyons and P.M. Kavanagh took effect on May 6.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
